@@ -0,0 +1,15 @@
+issueNumber: MDL-88618
+notes:
+  editor_tiny:
+    - message: >-
+        The bundled TinyMCE Accordion and List Styles (advlist) plugins are now
+        enabled by default. The Accordion plugin is available from the Insert
+        menu, and the List Styles plugin extends the existing bullet and
+        numbered list toolbar buttons with additional list style options.
+      type: improved
+  core:
+    - message: >-
+        The HTML purifier (`purify_html()`) now allows the `<details>` and
+        `<summary>` elements, including the `open` attribute, so that
+        accordion content created with TinyMCE is preserved by `format_text()`.
+      type: improved
